.TH tkuform n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkuform \- declarative form widget
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkuform
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkuform::widget .w \$fieldspec]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Builds a labelled form from a field specification (entry, password, check,
combo, spin, text) and collects the values as a dict. See docs/tkuform.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, form, dialog
